    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Encampment was once a booming center of copper mining and smelting at the turn of the twentieth century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Encampment%2C_Wyoming"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Encampment once featured a sixteen-mile steam powered tramway to carry copper ore, which was the longest in the world at the time.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Encampment%2C_Wyoming"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Tie hacks in Encampment cut timber and floated logs down creeks to supply ties for the Union Pacific Railroad.",
